<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>Dell Command | Configure - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This analysis provides information on the current configuration of the bios on Dell devices.</P>
<P>This analysis relies on <STRONG>Fixlet</STRONG>: <STRONG>Invoke - Dell Command | Configure Probe - Windows</STRONG> in the C3-Inventory site.</P>
<P>Information on using this content is available here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory/wiki/Dell-Command-%7C-Configure-Usage">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory/wiki/Dell-Command-%7C-Configure-Usage</A></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Inventory content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Inventory</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>exists file &quot;report.ini&quot; of folder (value &quot;Path&quot; of key &quot;HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\Software\Dell\CommandConfigure&quot; of x32 registry as string)</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
